      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Most people have some kind of overlay nowadays but I think an ingame time would still be nice to have and easier to access (depending on the overlay).\nI think it might even be a good idea to have it as an option next to the mic icon in the hud.\nPlease add a 24h option to. Not every country uses am/pm.\nAlso a seconds yes/no options. Seconds could be useful to time something ingame but aren't something you'd usually care about.",
